  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: UI_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5d2e35b805f4d0948bb5fa808a8ee211, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 690840727552
    m_Localized: "My scepter is incomplete! It originally had three pairs of wings
      and a heart, but now they\u2019re all gone! Go, find them and bring them back!
      Otherwise\u2026 you won\u2019t see Alice! I don\u2019t have time to wait too
      long, hurry up and get back quickly! What are you standing there for? Get to
      work!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32261635371008
    m_Localized: Hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 648562143232
    m_Localized: Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37043511029760
    m_Localized: Chinese
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37122884038656
    m_Localized: English
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37985417490432
    m_Localized: Finish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56766076350464
    m_Localized: Mission Failed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56920032473088
    m_Localized: Mission Complete!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57044762685440
    m_Localized: The Queen says you can't pass without the scepter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59356335894528
    m_Localized: 'So, you''ve brought the scepter!


      Brave player, your task
      is to find the four card suits: Hearts, Spades, Clubs, and Diamonds.

      Each
      suit holds a unique charm, and the correct cards will reveal the secret to
      the growth potion.


      Once you''ve found all the cards, enter their numbers
      in the console in the correct order.

      Complete this challenge, and you''ll
      earn the real growth potion to help your friend Alice!


      Good luck!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59872717631488
    m_Localized: The mission begins! Please enter the correct answer into the control
      panel behind you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60151701762048
    m_Localized: "Congratulations! You\u2019ve successfully solved the card puzzle
      and obtained the real growth potion!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60252830625792
    m_Localized: "The numbers you entered don\u2019t seem to be correct. Give it
      another try!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61838801825792
    m_Localized: Why did I shrink so much...? Help me figure something out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62295620251648
    m_Localized: Submit the potion!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62906206056448
    m_Localized: Did you bring the potion?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63227842064384
    m_Localized: Maybe there's something that can help me turn back...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63636027535360
    m_Localized: The growth potion!! Thank you!! I'm going to drink it now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 276347558621184
    m_Localized: "Oh dear, this is terrible! I just lost my gloves, but I can't give
      them to you directly. You know, I'm just too hungry right now\u2014my brain
      isn't working properly. Hmm... If you can help me find my three favorite things\u2014an
      ice cream, a donut, and a burger\u2014once my stomach is full, maybe I'll remember
      where I left the gloves. Please, I don't have time to waste\u2014the Queen's
      orders are not to be ignored!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 277228094025728
    m_Localized: "Oh, it's you. What are you doing here? You should know I don't
      just help people for no reason. Unless... you find that foolish rabbit's gloves\u2014those
      are the key to opening the secret door. I don\u2019t have the patience to wait
      too long. Now go, and come back to me once you have the gloves."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 277521758220288
    m_Localized: "Welcome to this mysterious Wonderland, adventurer!\nYou\u2019ve
      arrived at just the right time\u2014we need a brave soul like you.\n\nAlice
      has already drunk the shrinking potion and is now trapped in a hidden corner.
      We must find her and restore her to her original size.\n\nYour mission is to
      complete all the challenges, obtain the essential items, and ultimately find
      the growth potion. Only then can you help Alice escape her predicament and
      restore order to this world."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 277675114557440
    m_Localized: Hint 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 277741967568896
    m_Localized: Hint 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 282673437274112
    m_Localized: It seems you haven't gotten the Queen's scepter yet...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090258696466432
    m_Localized: Pass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090331069181952
    m_Localized: First, you need to find a green rabbit and talk to it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1092094794985472
    m_Localized: You got the gloves! The gate to another world has opened! Go explore!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1092376866123776
    m_Localized: "You didn\u2019t give me the gloves, so there\u2019s no way I can
      open the gate to another world!~~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1100107379437568
    m_Localized: 'Oh no, this is terrible!

      I just lost my gloves,

      but
      I''m too hungry to think straight.


      If you can help me find ice cream,
      a donut, and a burger,

      maybe I''ll remember where I left my gloves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1100817378635776
    m_Localized: Mission start! Hurry and find the next item!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1101081812725760
    m_Localized: You should go find a certain purple thing first. It seems to be
      in a corner somewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1101999731961856
    m_Localized: 'You haven''t found everything yet! Please place:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102071311953920
    m_Localized: On the yellow plate nearby!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102521729871872
    m_Localized: "Wow! You really found everything!\nIce cream, donuts, burgers,
      I\u2019m feeling so much better now!\nOh, by the way, my gloves... here you
      go.\nNow, go ahead and look for the red caterpillar!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105504970534912
    m_Localized: 'Choose language:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1116005431570432
    m_Localized: 'Please refer to the image below to understand the location and
      functions of the Focus button:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1116123979378688
    m_Localized: 'Button Selection:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1116226400088064
    m_Localized: 'Grab Item or Interact with Item:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
